cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 20-bit SAR ADC Behavioural Verification Model
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both this repository and the
  architecture it studies (ISSCC 2024, Session 9.8). See README.md section 10.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhao
    given-names: Reed
    alias: defineiocc02
    affiliation: Xidian University
version: 8.2.1
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/defineiocc02/20bit_SAR_ADC_Behaviour_Verification"
url: "https://github.com/defineiocc02/20bit_SAR_ADC_Behaviour_Verification"
abstract: >-
  A phase-accurate behavioural model of a two-stage residual SAR ADC, written
  to be audited rather than believed. Every model parameter carries a
  machine-checkable source grade (disclosed / derived / fitted / assumed /
  research-extension), so that a reviewer can see which published facts and
  which free assumptions a headline number rests on. Includes a physical
  18-slice pool with cross-cycle causality, a shared physical pipeline plus an independent algebraic oracle, and one adversarial regression
  per finding from an external audit of the previous release.
